<%#
  Automatically switch to profile (issue #1111). Settings window only: a card on
  the Profiles tab, after Stream Deck Profiles, inside the pane that the
  `profiles` platform flag gates (Elgato only — Mirabox and Ulanzi have no
  profile system). Emits items only; the window wraps them in the card.

  A master toggle, then one select per session kind. Each select stores a
  bundled profile's DISPLAY name, or "" for "Do not change the profile", every
  row's default — so turning the toggle on switches nothing until a row is
  picked. The rows stay enabled while the toggle is off, so the mapping can be
  set up first. sdpi-select round-trips the empty value: a stored "" matches the
  "" option, and `default=""` covers its falsy match.

  The setting keys and row labels are literals because markup cannot import;
  build/profile-auto-switch-partial.test.ts pins them to @iracedeck/app-constants
  (PROFILE_AUTO_SWITCH_ENABLED_KEY, PROFILE_FOR_SESSION_KIND_KEYS,
  PROFILE_SWITCH_SESSION_KIND_LABELS) and to the schema. The profile list comes
  from the generated, manifest-derived profiles.json, one option per template;
  an option's text drops the "iRaceDeck " prefix every template shares, while
  its value keeps the full display name the plugin resolves.

  The checkbox carries no `default`: off is the schema default, and
  `default="false"` would render it checked (a truthy string).
%>
<%
  var __kinds = [
    { label: 'Test', setting: 'profileForSessionKindTest' },
    { label: 'Practice', setting: 'profileForSessionKindPractice' },
    { label: 'Qualifying', setting: 'profileForSessionKindQualifying' },
    { label: 'Race', setting: 'profileForSessionKindRace' },
    { label: 'Replay', setting: 'profileForSessionKindReplay' }
  ];
  var __profileNames = [];
  require('./data/profiles.json').forEach(function (p) {
    var name = p.displayName || p.name;
    if (__profileNames.indexOf(name) < 0) __profileNames.push(name);
  });
%>
<sdpi-item label="Auto switch">
  <sdpi-checkbox setting="profileAutoSwitchEnabled" label="Switch profiles by session type" global></sdpi-checkbox>
</sdpi-item>
<div class="ird-supporting-text">
  When on, iRaceDeck switches every connected Stream Deck to the profile you pick below
  for the session type, and switches it back to the profile it was on when iRacing
  closes. Nothing switches until you pick a profile for at least one session type.
</div>
<% __kinds.forEach(function (kind) { %>
<sdpi-item label="<%= kind.label %>">
  <sdpi-select setting="<%= kind.setting %>" default="" global>
    <option value="">Do not change the profile</option>
<% __profileNames.forEach(function (name) { %>    <option value="<%= name %>"><%= name.replace(/^iRaceDeck /, '') %></option>
<% }); %>  </sdpi-select>
</sdpi-item>
<% }); %>
<div class="ird-supporting-text">
  Only iRaceDeck's own profiles can be picked: the Stream Deck app doesn't let a plugin
  switch to profiles you made yourself. To make one yours, edit it in the Stream Deck app.
</div>
